  - №500: $lim_(x -> 0) x^2 / (sqrt(1 + x sin x) - sqrt(cos x)) = lim_(x -> 0) (x^2 (sqrt(1 + x sin x) + sqrt(cos x)))/(x sin x + 1 - cos x) = 2 / (1 + 1/2) = 4/3$.

